"P74126010" "Repel the assault on City Hall!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3383608100" "Nothing"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2928729716" "<t=5><t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color darkblue><bgcolor white>This is Mayor Morales - if anyone's still out there, we have Nemesis forces attempting to breach the front gate of City Hall.<t=5><t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color darkblue><bgcolor white>Please... we don't have enough firepower to repel those things..."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2998433173" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color #6699BB><bgcolor #120F48><bordercolor #6699BB>Citadel, reporting. Skyway's defenses have been mobilized for a preemptive strike on local Nemesis forces.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color #6699BB><bgcolor #120F48><bordercolor #6699BB>They appear to have been taken off guard, and are currently in full retreat."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3216820333" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor chocolate>This is LeoKnight. Skyway City is under heavy assault from Nemesis forces! We need assistance!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4133374328" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color #999999><bgcolor #340F12><bordercolor #999999>Manticore here. We caught a platoon attempting to take over the local WRNI radio station. Just in time, too. The signal they were using would have activated automatons all over the city."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2724109984" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor GoldenRod>This is Katie Wenderburg of WRNI radio - we have intruders in the building. Please, to anyone listening, we need immediate assistance. They're attempting to broadcast- NO! Get away! Don't touch me, you-*kschhhhhhhh*"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3929749365" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color #CCCCCD><bgcolor #323232><bordercolor #CCCCCD>This is Brawler. Portal Corp. seems to be all clear. Not sure what we're supposed to be looking for out here."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3243925762" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color darkgrey><bgcolor white>This is Faultline, reporting in. Peregrine's quiet. Maintaining high alert status, but I haven't seen anything suspicious yet."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3611958691" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color #3299DD><bgcolor #6B5242><bordercolor #3299DD>This is Positron. I found some Freakshow punks vandalizing a power converter, but no sign of Nemesis in Terra Volta."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2201821837" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor darkgreen>Serpent Drummer here. Terra Volta is secured, no sign of enemy activity."
